{% doc %}
  The free-delivery banner. Sits at the very top of the order summary on
  the cart page and at the top of the drawer's summary, so it is the
  first thing read before the total and the Check out button.

  Threshold comes from shop.metafields.custom.free_shipping_threshold (the
  same field the announcement strip and the policy summary read), so one
  edit in Admin moves all three. It must match the free-delivery rule on
  every zone in Settings → Shipping. Falls back to ₹2,000 if the field is
  ever cleared. Free delivery applies across India.

  Under ₹1,500 it states the threshold; from ₹1,500 it counts down with
  a progress bar; at the threshold it confirms free delivery.

  The bar is decoration — the sentence carries the information — so it
  is aria-hidden. The wrapper is a polite live region so a quantity change
  that crosses the threshold is announced.

  @param {string} [context] - 'page' (default) or 'drawer'

  @example
  {% render 'sv-cart-ship', context: 'drawer' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign context = context | default: 'page'
  assign free_at = shop.metafields.custom.free_shipping_threshold.value | default: 200000
  assign remaining = free_at | minus: cart.total_price
  assign progress = cart.total_price | times: 100 | divided_by: free_at
  if progress > 100
    assign progress = 100
  endif

  # Three states. "Add ₹X more" only once the bag is within reach
  # (₹1,500 and up) — below that, a ₹1,551 gap reads as a push, so the
  # banner simply states the threshold and drops the bar.
  assign nudge_from = 150000
  if remaining <= 0
    assign state = 'free'
  elsif cart.total_price >= nudge_from
    assign state = 'nudge'
  else
    assign state = 'info'
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="sv-cart-ship sv-cart-ship--{{ context }}{% if state == 'free' %} is-free{% endif %}"
  role="status"
  aria-live="polite"
>
  <p class="sv-cart-ship__line">
    {%- case state -%}
      {%- when 'free' -%}
        <strong>You&rsquo;ve unlocked free delivery</strong> on this order.
      {%- when 'nudge' -%}
        Add <strong>{{ remaining | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</strong> more for free delivery across India.
      {%- else -%}
        <strong>Free delivery</strong> on orders over {{ free_at | money_without_trailing_zeros }}, anywhere in India.
    {%- endcase -%}
  </p>
  {%- if state == 'nudge' -%}
    <span class="sv-cart-ship__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width: {{ progress }}%"></i></span>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
